{"id":"tina","lemma":"tina","pos":"noun","rank":1862,"glosses":["vat","large earthenware jar","bucket"],"ipa":"/ˈtina/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"tinas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bd/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-tina.wav","examples":[{"text":"La tina está sucia.","en":"The bathtub is dirty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/516483","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"dirty, filthy","l":"sucio"}]},{"text":"Él tiene el agua andando en la tina.","en":"He has the water running in the bathtub.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"water"},{"g":"to walk, to go","l":"andar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Ya que estás aquí, sería mejor que te metieras a la tina.","en":"As long as you're here, you'd better take a bath.","words":[null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"better"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to put in, insert","l":"meter"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"because"]]},{"text":"Tom quería que Mary limpiara la tina.","en":"Tom wanted Mary to clean the bathtub.","words":[null,{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"to clean","l":"limpiar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}